d_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-13T20:05:36Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T20:05:52Z"},{"id":638118200,"node_id":"RA_kwDORwA07s4mCOk4","name":"stable-win-x64-Gloomberb.tar.zst","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":312452542,"digest":"sha256:536b9741a38d8aa7479c5a72c31a46231e9368de4291b51d6826ea0c981c824a","download_count":5,"created_at":"2026-10-13T20:05:36Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T20:05:51Z"},{"id":638118187,"node_id":"RA_kwDORwA07s4mCOkr","name":"stable-win-x64-GloomberbSetup.exe","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-msdos-program","state":"uploaded","size":289854019,"digest":"sha256:53a532b94881bc9a06a0192f07896ef675f30da8427d6e00bc41313d5dbd6289","download_count":32,"created_at":"2026-10-13T20:05:36Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T20:05:49Z"},{"id":638118185,"node_id":"RA_kwDORwA07s4mCOkp","name":"stable-win-x64-update.json","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":73,"digest":"sha256:9a4b76e591bf28ad6ee4c2637a6c5f8ad0685adc284c89d462727680abf2287e","download_count":18,"created_at":"2026-10-13T20:05:36Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T20:05:37Z"}],"body":"## Highlights\n\n- **Calmer reading text.** The Changelog, Trials detail, news and Search stories and Docs read at a size close to the rest of the app, with a clear step from title to heading to body to metadata. (#1796)\n- **Undo for layout changes.** `Cmd+Z` undoes the last layout change again. (#1787)\n- **More option and pair charts.** A linked option contract charts its daily premium, and a pair such as `GAA/VOO` charts as the ratio of the two tickers. (#1789, #1784)\n- **Options on the command line.** `options --leaps` gets an expiry window and cost columns, and `OMON` on an unlisted expiry fails the way `options` does. (#1792, #1791)\n- **Estimates say what they are.** `ERN`, the board and `EE` label an upcoming estimate as adjusted when Gloom Cloud names its basis, and `ERN` shows the report status and analysts beside the estimate. (#1794, #1785)\n\n## Also in this release\n\n- Open interest shows the date the chain states. (#1786)\n- The Vienna MTF is a known venue, with its name, clock, session and holidays. (#1793)\n\n[Full diff](https://github.com/gloom-sh/gloomberb/compare/v0.17.1...v0.17.2)\n"}
